# Generated Vite bundle: force LF regardless of a committer's autocrlf
# setting, so the CI byte-diff guard (test.yml, `git diff --exit-code -- web/
# web-chunks/`) never false-positives on line-ending noise instead of a real
# web-src/ change. Marked generated and diff-suppressed since nobody reviews
# minified/vendored output by eye.
/web/omnicam.js linguist-generated=true -diff eol=lf
/web-chunks/** linguist-generated=true -diff eol=lf
